<title>USA: ThermoGenesis gets $3.9 mln freezer order.</title>
<headline>ThermoGenesis gets $3.9 mln freezer order.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO CORDOVA, Calif. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>ThermoGenesis Corp said Monday that it received a $3.9 million order from Centeon Corp, an Armour and Behring company, for the purchase and installation of plasma freezers.</p>
<p>In a release Monday ThermoGenesis said the order, expected to be completed during fiscal year 1997, was for MP200OC freezers at all 32 of Centeon's plasma collection facilities.</p>
</text>
